# PostHog — publishable project API key (client-safe; ships in the client bundle).
# Find it in PostHog → Project Settings → Project API Key (starts with `phc_`).
#
# Production/preview: set NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY in the Vercel project env. Events
#   post to the same-origin `/relay` path, which `vercel.json` reverse-proxies to
#   PostHog US — so ad-blocker filter lists (which match *.posthog.com) don't fire.
# Local dev: NOT required. The `/relay` proxy only exists on the Vercel deploy, so
#   analytics is verified on a preview deploy; local dev intentionally stays inert
#   when this is unset. (Set it in `.env.local` if you want posthog-js to init.)
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
